## Important

Keep the original configuration files you downloaded from your machine as a backup.

If you run into problems with the new configuration, you can use these files to restore your original setup.

This is your "get out of jail card". If you really mess things up, you can revert to factory settings as a last resort:

https://github.com/qidi-community/q2-wiki/blob/main/content/stock-firmware-flash/README.md

Please read it carefully and follow it exactly. Point 7 is especially important.
